1
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,830
我从没见过他这么欢乐
I've never seen him this happy before.

2
00:00:10,830 --> 00:00:11,890
那是因为你从来没有在
That's because you've never seen him

3
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:14,520
"医药箱补货日"见过他
on "Restock the Medicine Cabinet Day."

4
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:15,920
你们看
Look!

5
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:18,610
新出的带麻药局部抗组胺剂呢
A new topical antihistamine with lidocaine.

6
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,710
好想赶快发疹子来用用看啊
I can't wait until I get a rash.

7
00:00:23,930 --> 00:00:27,290
解胀气药也出了加强版呢
Oh, Gas-X has a new ultra strength.

8
00:00:27,290 --> 00:00:29,460
看来他们真会看顾客意见邮箱啊
I guess they really do read their mail.

9
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:34,100
那不是质子教授吗
Hey, isn't that Professor Proton?

10
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,470
是啊
Oh, yeah.

11
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:41,930
你们看他  像普通人一样排队
Look at him, just standing in line

12
00:00:41,930 --> 00:00:45,240
好像自己30年前并不是个二流名人似地
like he wasn't moderately famous 30 years ago.

13
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:47,020
去跟他打招呼吧
Let's go say hello.

14
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:49,070
我们还是别烦人家比较好吧
Oh, maybe we shouldn't bother him.

15
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:51,690
我没有要去烦他啊  我是要去跟他聊聊
I'm not going to bother him, I'm going to talk to him.

16
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:55,340
他总以为这两者不一样
He thinks there's a difference.

17
00:00:55,530 --> 00:00:56,530
亚瑟
Arthur?

18
00:00:57,180 --> 00:00:58,320
亚瑟  是我啊
Arthur, it's me--

19
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,580
谢尔顿·库珀
Sheldon Cooper.

20
00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:03,120
你可能因为年事已高忘了我是谁了
You may not remember because of your advanced age.

21
00:01:03,970 --> 00:01:06,780
相信我  你化成灰我也认得
Trust me, I... I remember.

22
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:08,980
这位是我的女朋友  艾米
This is my girlfriend, Amy.

23
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:11,660
艾米  这位是电视圈传奇亚瑟·杰弗里斯
Amy, this is television legend Arthur Jeffries.

24
00:01:11,660 --> 00:01:15,390
他的科普节目启发了无数孩子
His science show inspired millions of children.

25
00:01:15,390 --> 00:01:17,440
等  等等
Ho-hold on.

26
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:20,350
你...  你有女朋友啊
You... You have a girlfriend?

27
00:01:21,450 --> 00:01:23,700
是的  久仰大名啊
Yes, and I've heard so much about you.

28
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:27,420
而且你看  我们穿着同款矫正鞋呢
Hey look-- we're wearing the same orthopedic shoes.

29
00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:30,640
真不敢相信我跟名人穿同样的鞋
I can't believe I dress like a celebrity.

30
00:01:32,930 --> 00:01:35,550
现在我明白了
O-Okay, I get it now.

31
00:01:36,740 --> 00:01:39,270
你好  我是莱纳德·霍夫斯塔德
Dr. Jeffries, hello again. Leonard Hofstadter.

32
00:01:39,270 --> 00:01:42,610
是你啊  我记得你的女朋友
Oh, oh, right, I remember your-your girlfriend.

33
00:01:44,410 --> 00:01:47,260
她...  她在吗
Is-Is she... is she here?

34
00:01:48,230 --> 00:01:49,940
她不在这里
No, she's not.

35
00:01:50,180 --> 00:01:51,990
你是来补什么药的存货呢
So, what prescription are you getting filled?

36
00:01:51,990 --> 00:01:53,790
-谢尔顿  -别说  让我猜猜
- Sheldon. - Wait, I want to guess.

37
00:01:53,790 --> 00:01:55,250
别告诉我答案
Don't tell me.

38
00:01:55,250 --> 00:01:58,050
我本来就没打算告诉你
I wasn't going to tell you.

39
00:01:58,450 --> 00:01:59,510
谢尔顿  别玩了
Sheldon, come on.

40
00:01:59,510 --> 00:02:00,730
不不不  玩这个我最拿手了
No, no, no. I'm really good at this.

41
00:02:00,730 --> 00:02:01,670
好  给我的提示
All right, give me a hint.

42
00:02:01,670 --> 00:02:06,640
是不是跟排某些液体有困难有关
Does it involve difficulty initiating a stream of anything?

43
00:02:07,660 --> 00:02:12,630
看我的年纪就知道  猜中很容易吧
Well, given my age, that's more than just a lucky guess.

44
00:02:12,630 --> 00:02:14,320
谢尔顿  我们还是去取笑
Hey, Sheldon, let's go mock the people

45
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:17,070
买顺势疗法药的人吧  你不是很喜欢吗
buying homeopathic medicine-- you love that.

46
00:02:17,070 --> 00:02:18,670
但是我现在跟朋友一起
But I'm hanging out with my friend,

47
00:02:18,670 --> 00:02:19,920
我们聊得正欢呢
and we're having fun.

48
00:02:19,920 --> 00:02:22,530
你看他多开心
Look how happy he is.

49
00:02:51,510 --> 00:02:54,690
妮妮这周五要在家里办闺蜜之夜
Bernie's having a girls' night on Friday at our place.

50
00:02:54,690 --> 00:02:56,050
不如那晚咱俩出去玩呀
You want to do something?

51
00:02:56,050 --> 00:02:58,600
-那晚我有事呢  -什么事
- Actually, I'm busy. - Doing what?

52
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:01,020
科罗拉多大街那边开了一家新体育酒吧...
There's a new sports bar over on Colorado Ave...

53
00:03:01,020 --> 00:03:02,530
-你也要去参加闺蜜之夜  -是啦
- You're going to girls' night. - Yeah.

54
00:03:05,340 --> 00:03:07,440
你知道她们是要串珠宝的对吧
You know they're making jewelry, right?

55
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:09,810
你以为那主意是她们想出来的吗
You think they came up with that?

56
00:03:10,320 --> 00:03:12,930
她们本来是要喝啤酒  射飞镖好吗
They were going to drink beer and play darts.

57
00:03:13,990 --> 00:03:14,920
怎么样啦[什么上升]
What's up?

58
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:17,370
绝对不是他的睾丸酮水平
Not his testosterone levels.

59
00:03:17,370 --> 00:03:18,320
别乱说
Excuse me.

60
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:21,420
人家对自己的男子气概很满意好咩
I happen to be very comfortable with my masculinity.

61
00:03:21,420 --> 00:03:23,780
这怎么可能
How is that possible?

62
00:03:27,770 --> 00:03:31,110
质子教授给我发了电邮
Hey, I got an email from Professor Proton.

63
00:03:31,110 --> 00:03:32,620
好耶  他说什么了
Goody! What's it say?

64
00:03:32,620 --> 00:03:35,440
他在写一篇纳米真空管的论文
He's working on a paper about nano vacuum tubes,

65
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:37,920
问我能不能帮他看看
and wants to know if I'd take a look at it.

66
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:39,850
奇怪
That's strange.

67
00:03:39,850 --> 00:03:42,550
他居然会找你  而不是找我帮忙
That he would come to you for that and not me.

68
00:03:43,830 --> 00:03:46,200
我收到他两封电邮呢
Oh, I got two emails from him.

69
00:03:46,970 --> 00:03:50,020
"你有莱纳德的邮箱吗"
"Do you have Leonard's email address?"

70
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,910
还有
And...

71
00:03:53,910 --> 00:03:56,600
"不用了  我找到了"
"Never mind, I found it."

72
00:03:57,950 --> 00:04:00,490
他居然会选你不选我
I can't believe he picked you over me.

73
00:04:00,490 --> 00:04:02,800
你也不会想看一篇好几十年没正经
You don't want to read a paper by some old has-been

74
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:06,160
