who hasn't done any real science in decades.

75
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:08,040
这有什么好哭诉的
Yeah, it's nothing to cry about.

76
00:04:08,380 --> 00:04:10,650
谢尔顿·库伯才不哭呢
Sheldon Cooper does not cry.

77
00:04:10,650 --> 00:04:13,220
有道理  你个机器人碰水会生锈
It's true, you'd rust.

78
00:04:18,250 --> 00:04:20,920
想到我居然曾经当他是我偶像
And to think I idolized that man.

79
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:22,280
我何苦呢
And why?

80
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:25,350
说到底  他不过也是个好莱坞伪君子罢了
At the end of the day he's just another Hollywood phony.

81
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:28,620
这事情真的值得你不开心吗
Is it really worth getting upset about?

82
00:04:28,620 --> 00:04:30,510
常言道  别见你心中的英雄
They say don't meet your heroes.

83
00:04:30,510 --> 00:04:33,510
不要窥探他们名望与名声背后的真实
Don't peek behind that curtain of fame and celebrity,

84
00:04:33,510 --> 00:04:36,390
如果你犯了这禁忌  你会看到真实的他们
because if you do, you'll see them as they really are--

85
00:04:36,390 --> 00:04:38,670
堕落的卖笑戏子
degenerate carnival folk.

86
00:04:40,350 --> 00:04:42,630
别这样  他只是个退休的儿童节目主持
Come on, he's a retired kids show host.

87
00:04:42,630 --> 00:04:43,800
这才更糟呢
That's even worse.

88
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:46,010
用美好的科学当糖果
Using the sweet candy of science

89
00:04:46,010 --> 00:04:48,130
骗取小孩对他的爱慕
to trick children into loving him.

90
00:04:49,330 --> 00:04:50,740
死淫贼
Pervert.

91
00:04:53,380 --> 00:04:54,570
你有仔细想过
Have you ever thought about

92
00:04:54,570 --> 00:04:57,300
为什么亚瑟没找你读论文吗
why Arthur didn't want you to read his paper?

93
00:04:57,310 --> 00:04:58,710
我想过
Yes, I have.

94
00:04:58,710 --> 00:05:00,040
我唯一的结论就是
And my only conclusion

95
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:01,910
他那天在药房买的药
is the prescription he was picking up the other day

96
00:05:01,910 --> 00:05:03,770
是要治神经病的
was for cuckoo pills.

97
00:05:05,020 --> 00:05:08,320
有可能是他觉得你有点过了吧
Maybe he found you, um, a bit much.

98
00:05:09,430 --> 00:05:11,660
你这话说得才过吧
That's kind of a stretch.

99
00:05:11,660 --> 00:05:13,310
要说社交技巧
Look, when it comes to social skills,

100
00:05:13,310 --> 00:05:14,760
我已经掌握了三大技巧
I've mastered the big three.

101
00:05:14,760 --> 00:05:16,890
首先是腼腆一笑
There's the coy smile.

102
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,650
以及友善的轻笑
There's the friendly chuckle.

103
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:25,850
以及如何发出同情音
There's the vocalization of sympathy.

104
00:05:28,540 --> 00:05:31,590
最后这个太难了  我还在练
That last one's tricky, I'm still working on it.

105
00:05:32,350 --> 00:05:34,280
就我那天看到的情况来看
From what I saw the other day,

106
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:36,920
我能理解他或...
I could understand why he and...

107
00:05:37,450 --> 00:05:40,100
有些人可能会觉得你
some people might find you...

108
00:05:41,750 --> 00:05:43,280
什么
What?

109
00:05:45,010 --> 00:05:46,340
算了
Doesn't matter.

110
00:05:47,020 --> 00:05:49,430
不行  快说
No, go ahead, say it.

111
00:05:49,430 --> 00:05:50,930
我知道你想说什么
I know what it is.

112
00:05:50,930 --> 00:05:52,370
我这辈子听过无数遍了
I've heard it my whole life.

113
00:05:52,370 --> 00:05:53,560
你想说的是"惹人厌"
The word's "annoying".

114
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,870
说吧  说吧
Go ahead, say it.

115
00:05:54,870 --> 00:05:56,860
快说  说我惹人厌
Say it. Say I'm annoying.

116
00:05:56,860 --> 00:05:57,580
谢尔顿
Sheldon...

117
00:05:57,580 --> 00:05:59,200
我才不会觉得受伤
Oh, it won't hurt my feelings.

118
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:01,030
说吧  艾米  说我惹人厌啊
Go ahead, Amy, say I'm annoying.

119
00:06:01,030 --> 00:06:03,500
我惹人厌  我超级惹人厌
I'm annoying. I'm annoying.

120
00:06:03,500 --> 00:06:04,800
我最惹人厌了  没错
I'm annoying. Yeah, now, uh...

121
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:05,730
你要去哪里
Now where are you going?

122
00:06:05,730 --> 00:06:08,200
你知道你想说出口  快说啊
Look, you know you want to say it-- say it.

123
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:10,690
说我惹人厌  快说啊
Say I'm annoying. Go ahead, say it.

124
00:06:11,180 --> 00:06:14,390
说啊  艾米  快说啊
Say it. Say it. Amy, say it.

125
00:06:16,990 --> 00:06:19,350
这妞不能忍受我是对的就走啊
Well, she can't stand it when I'm right.

126
00:06:21,510 --> 00:06:22,690
真有意思
This is fun.

127
00:06:22,690 --> 00:06:24,460
我会像戴着珠宝的那种傲娇的贵妇
I'm going to feel like such a vixen wearing jewelry

128
00:06:24,460 --> 00:06:27,520
只不过我不会对一大堆药物过敏
that doesn't have a list of medications I'm allergic to.

129
00:06:28,460 --> 00:06:30,000
佩妮  你做得怎么样
Penny, how's it going over there?

130
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:32,960
很好  只是我有点搞不定胶水
Good-- I'm just having little trouble with the glue.

131
00:06:34,590 --> 00:06:36,330
你难道不会用胶水吗
How do you not know how to use glue?

132
00:06:36,330 --> 00:06:38,430
你学前班老逃课了吧
Did you ditch pre-school?

133
00:06:38,890 --> 00:06:42,090
是啊  当时我忙着跟二年级的学生约会呢
Yeah, but only because I was dating a second grader.

134
00:06:44,550 --> 00:06:45,900
各位好啊
Hello, everyone.

135
00:06:45,900 --> 00:06:48,290
好吧  你想说什么就说吧
Okay, let me have it.

136
00:06:48,290 --> 00:06:51,260
你只管开"拉杰是娘们"的玩笑好了
Let's hear all the "Raj is a girl" jokes.

137
00:06:51,260 --> 00:06:51,920
你想错了
Nope.

138
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:54,610
伯纳黛特说这样不对  她不许我这样
Bernadette told me it isn't nice and I'm not allowed.

139
00:06:54,610 --> 00:06:55,300
那还真是多谢了
Thank you.

140
00:06:55,300 --> 00:06:56,760
所以我不会嘲笑你
So I won't be making fun of you,

141
00:06:56,760 --> 00:06:57,970
也不会耻笑你喜欢的事物
or the things you like,

142
00:06:57,970 --> 00:07:01,380
更不会讥笑你"只想玩乐"的事实
or the fact that you just want to have fun.

143
00:06:57,970 --> 00:07:01,380
源自辛迪·劳帕的著名单曲《Girls Just Wanna Have Fun 女孩们只想玩乐》

144
00:07:04,470 --> 00:07:05,740
华仔  别说了
Howie, stop.

145
00:07:05,740 --> 00:07:07,590
过来看看我做的东西
Come on, look at what I'm making.

146
00:07:08,580 --> 00:07:09,860
还挺好看的嘛
Oh, that's actually pretty nice.

147
00:07:09,860 --> 00:07:11,020
我在做手镯
I'm making a bracelet.

148
00:07:11,020 --> 00:07:13,160
而我做的是"一团糟"
Yeah, I'm just making a mess.

149
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:17,940
你们其实可以拿我的焊铁玩
You know, instead of beads and glue,

150
00:07:17,940 --> 00:07:19,340
而不是在这光玩珠子和胶水
you guys can use my soldering iron.

151
00:07:19,340 --> 00:07:21,140
这样你们可以做更酷的东西
You'd be able to make much cooler stuff.

152
00:07:21,140 --> 00:07:24,710
我觉得这样就挺好  谢啦
Oh, I think we're doing just fine, thank you.

153
00:07:24,710 --> 00:07:27,420
-老实说  我想试试  -我也是
- Actually, I'd kind of like to try that. - Me, too.

154
00:07:27,420 --> 00:07:29,270
马上给你们拿来
Be right back.

155
00:07:29,890 --> 00:07:32,540
我胳膊上怎么黏有开心果
When did I have pistachios?

156
00:07:37,860 --> 00:07:38,970
亚瑟
Arthur.

157
00:07:39,550 --> 00:07:40,680
亚瑟
Arthur.

158
00:07:41,250 --> 00:07:42,700
亚瑟
Arthur.

159
00:07:44,090 --> 00:07:45,710
门环
Door knocker.

160
00:07:45,710 --> 00:07:47,930
从那个电视节目赚的吧
That's TV money.

161
00:07:45,710 --> 00:07:47,930
同名DIY电视节目

162
00:07:51,050 --> 00:07:52,730
谢尔顿  你来这儿干嘛
Sheldon, what are you doing here?

163
00:07:53,110 --> 00:07:55,450
抱歉  我吵醒你了吗
I'm sorry, did I wake you?

164
00:07:55,450 --> 00:07:58,090
当然啦  现在都晚上7点半了
Of course you woke me, it's 7:30.

165
00:08:00,290 --> 00:08:01,850
本来我可以早点到的
Well, I would have been here sooner,

166
00:08:01,850 --> 00:08:03,310
但不知道为什么
but for some reason your home

167
00:08:03,310 --> 00:08:06,510
你家不在"好莱坞明星之家"这幅地图上
isn't on this map of Hollywood stars.

168
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:08,890
你找我有事吗  谢尔顿
What do you want, Sheldon?

169
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:11,910
我的女朋友指出
It's been pointed out by my girlfriend

170
00:08:11,910 --> 00:08:14,440
那天我可能惹到你了
that I may have been annoying to you.

171
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:16,900
这么懂事的姑娘你可别放手
She sounds like a keeper.

172
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:20,600
总之我想跟你道歉
Anyway, I wanted to apologize.

173
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,070
真的很对不起
I am truly sorry.

174
00:08:22,070 --> 00:08:24,270
好的  我接受你的道歉  晚安
All right, apology accepted. Have a nice night.

175
00:08:24,270 --> 00:08:27,050
不  还有呢  既然我们冰释前嫌
No, no, now that... we've cleared the air,

176
00:08:27,050 --> 00:08:29,740
我还想跟你商量一件事
I wanted to discuss another matter with you.

177
00:08:29,740 --> 00:08:32,440
谢尔顿  再过两个小时  我就得起床
Sheldon, in a couple hours, I have to get up,

